WEBVTT

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.510
I won!

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:35.470
Success!

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:39.970
<i>Did I get carried away?</i>

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.820
The color has changed.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.990
This looks much better!

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.950
Excellent work.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:58.030
What? Uh, thanks.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:02.540
You have fought brilliantly by pushing Vox Aura’s abilities to its limits.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.420
I’m Moid, and you have made a lasting impression on me.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.380
Ox what?

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.000
Vox Aura.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.000
It’s the name of that Ovid.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.720
Oh, so that’s its name?

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:17.050
Lan!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:21.350
Were you watching?

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:22.390
Yes…

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:25.020
This robot is amazing!

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:28.190
I didn’t think it would be that easy to pilot.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:29.560
Easy?

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:30.650
Yup!

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.030
It moves just the way I tell it to.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:36.740
What’s wrong?

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:37.530
Nothing.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:43.660
It’s red.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:44.910
I hit my head.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:52.000
I’m sorry to interrupt.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.050
I am Tadokoro, the Fleet Captain here.

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:58.510
I would like to conduct a briefing before your next mission.

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:01.760
Next? There’s going to be more?

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:03.720
Woof.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.440
Can I… go to the restroom first?

